### 1. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "example_user",
  "password": "ChooseYourOwnPassword123!"
}


### 2. Log in
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "example_user",
  "password": "ChooseYourOwnPassword123!"
}


### 3. Get CSRF token (requires login)
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/csrf


### 4. Get all applications (requires login)
GET http://localhost:8080/applications


### 5. Get one application (requires login)
GET http://localhost:8080/applications/1


### 6. Create an application (requires login and CSRF token)
POST http://localhost:8080/applications
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_TOKEN

{
  "company": "Example Company",
  "position": "Software Engineering Intern",
  "status": "APPLIED"
}


### 7. Update an application's status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_TOKEN

{
  "status": "INTERVIEW"
}


### 8. Delete an application
DELETE http://localhost:8080/applications/1
X-CSRF-Token: REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_TOKEN


### 9. Log out
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: REPLACE_WITH_CSRF_TOKEN


### 10. Check application health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health